# WEP Cracking Lab

## Objective

To understand the weaknesses of WEP encryption in an authorized home-lab environment.

## Lab Environment

- Kali Linux VM
- Authorized wireless router configured for WEP
- USB wireless adapter
- Aircrack-ng tools

## Tools Used

- airmon-ng
- airodump-ng
- aireplay-ng
- aircrack-ng

## What I Learned

- How WEP uses initialization vectors
- Why repeated IVs make WEP vulnerable
- How wireless packets can be captured and analysed
- Why WEP should no longer be used

## Disclaimer

This lab was performed only on equipment that I own and control for educational purposes.
